# Fixed defect 2463, 2026-11-10, lane b30-pkg: `use <main>/main`, the line
# `heroes new main --package` offered, and another module of a package named
# `main`.
#
# SYMPTOM: `shadowed_binding` against the program's `function main()`, the
# line a verb offered refused once written.
#
# FIX: `main` is no entry's name, the entry point every program declares, so
# the line is told so at the name, as a keyword there is (defect 2432), and
# no verb or catalogue holds the name.
use <main>/main  #~ package_wants_a_name
use <main>/strings  #~ package_wants_a_name

function main()
    print("x")
